Quick start
· Press [ctrl+k] to search everything, [,] to open the settings and [?]
  for this help.
· Open a list with [1-4], move with [↑↓], press [⏎] to use a record and
  [n] to add one.
· [esc] goes back and [q] quits from the welcome page and the lists,
  changes are saved at once.

Welc
